summary:
  The footer says live radio is still being buffered for every park.

history:
  It said "the station keeps recording" for every park, also where
  nothing was fetched any more, and recording is the word for files the
  listener keeps. It says buffering while the writer runs and plain Paused
  after.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
      readonly property bool tsBuffering: _tsPaused && timeshift.writerUp   //

replace:
      readonly property bool tsBuffering: _tsPaused   //

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_pause_a_window_old_ends_the_capture_and_the_footer_says_what_is_true.
  Line-neutral.
